{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394800/extras/b7c98fb48e0e3a521995f44f0a2f75c9.webp?t=1773248458\" width=616 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394800/extras/8841161e80e58c8312150e6b4cd4cdcb.poster.avif?t=1773248458\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394800/extras/8841161e80e58c8312150e6b4cd4cdcb.webm?t=1773248458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394800/extras/8841161e80e58c8312150e6b4cd4cdcb.mp4?t=1773248458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a high school graduate, who recently got a job as a barista in the hopes of breaking out of your shell. Confront the challenges of growing up through the bonds you create and the coffee you serve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394800/extras/0ff990e39e3e9162352b7f7d117b325c.poster.avif?t=1773248458\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394800/extras/0ff990e39e3e9162352b7f7d117b325c.webm?t=1773248458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394800/extras/0ff990e39e3e9162352b7f7d117b325c.mp4?t=1773248458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully voice-acted</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brew and mix a variety of drinks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Converse with your customers and learn their story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original Soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tropical island setting inspired by the Philippines and Dubrovnik</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All visuals hand-drawn by PluviiArt</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a coming-of-age story, and the struggles of growing up</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Designs Inspired by Y2K Fashion and Dark Academia Fashion</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3394800?t=1773248458","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394800/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773248458","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394800/4ecc1f4c42a7d17e3daf999cb8e461ff0b341e6a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773248458","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394800/4ecc1f4c42a7d17e3daf999cb8e461ff0b341e6a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773248458","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3394800/extras/b7c98fb48e0e3a521995f44f0a2f75c9.webp?t=1773248458\" width=616 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/